rder-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">4. </span><b>Same model as above but with the covariate habitat </b><u></u><u></u></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">Occupancy:</span><u></u><u></u></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">              Estimate    SE      z P(&gt;|z|)<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">(Intercept)     -0.849  0.95 -0.894   0.371<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">habitatRiffle    8.512 46.29  0.184   0.854<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">habitatRun       0.846  1.47  0.576   0.565<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">Detection:<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\"> Estimate    SE      z P(&gt;|z|)<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">   -0.309 0.489 -0.632   0.527</span></span><u></u><u></u></pre>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p>5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">      \r\n</span>Same model as above with distance as a covariate<u></u><u></u></p>